{"articleNo":"427035","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=427035&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] 금오공대 선배와의 대화(안보특강) 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.03.15","hit":"3067","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmGYHoShVBZARgG2QNwE4AsCe8BKA6gA6GwDKAMgEIDuALgHTEB2A5kA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">* 금오공과대학교 학생군사교육단에서 <b>금오공대 선배와의 대화(리더십 및 소통, 안보상황 변화에 대한 대응</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><b>)</b>을 진행합니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 1.&nbsp;일정: <b>2023.03.24.(금) 10:00 ~ 12:00</b></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 2.&nbsp;장소: <b>디지털관 시청각실(DB</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><b>127호)</b></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 3. 강사:&nbsp; 예)중장 박양동(학군26기, 前군수사령관, 現 초빙교수)&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;예)소장 이경일(학군27기, 前정보화기획참모부장, 現 초빙교수)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 4. 교육대상: <b>재학생 1~2학년&nbsp;중 희망자</b></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 5.&nbsp;신청방법: 학생역량관리시스템(Biskit) 개인 비교과프로그램 신청</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 6.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">문의: 금오공과대학교 학생군사교육단(054-478-7272, 7275)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: 굴림; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.8; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 담당자 대위 백승환(010-3988-5347)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; * 교육 간&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><b>간식(햄버거)</b>이 제공</span>되며, 사전신청하지 않고 참석한 인원은 간식제공이 제한될 수 있습니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
